# Market S authorised brands (learned 2026-11-05)

## Invariant

Trust marketing for supply partners is a **CMS list** (`marketSAuthorisedBrands` in `storefront_cms`), not DermaFirm-only hardcoding and not a long homepage Category Description.

## Surfaces

| Surface | Behavior |
|---|---|
| **Admin → Content → Market S** | Manage authorised brands (name, tagline, logo, link, active) |
| **`/hot-goods` hub** | Trust strip when ≥1 active brand |
| **Hub cards / Market S PDP** | `Authorised` badge when `product.brand` matches an active row (normalised) |
| **Homepage category card** | Keep **short** Description (benefit line only) — do not paste partner essays |

## Product brand

Admin Market S form Brand field must match the authorised list name (spacing/case tolerant via `normalizeMarketSBrandKey`). New partners = add CMS row + set SKU brand — no code deploy.

## Do not

- Redesign homepage Hero for brand trust
- Hardcode a single brand in hub UI
- Put long authorised-partner copy on the home Category Description
